'' A label shares its name with a variable, a parameter or a constant, and never hides
'' one; a second label of the name in one PROCEDURE is TKO0600, fbc's 4. See
'' DeclareLabel_ in symbols/collectdecl.bas.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: --dump-ir tests/diagnostics/src/label-namespace.bas
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 1
'' EXPECT-OUT: label-namespace.bas(31,1): error TKO0600: 'dup' is already declared in this scope
'' EXPECT-OUT: label-namespace.bas(38,1): error TKO0600: 'ee' is already declared in this scope
'' EXPECT-OUT: 0 statements not lowered
'' EXPECT-NOT: label-namespace.bas(9,
'' EXPECT-NOT: label-namespace.bas(23,
'' EXPECT-NOT: label-namespace.bas(27,
'' EXPECT-MAX-DIAG: 2
